flowchart TD
    WORK["background work / updates needed"] --> CRITICAL{time-critical and user-facing}
    CRITICAL -->|yes - alarm/nav/playback| EXACT["exact alarm / typed FGS - sparingly (Ch 47/49)"]
    CRITICAL -->|no - most work| DEFER["WorkManager + constraints (UNMETERED, charging, idle) - Doze-aware (Ch 47/48)"]
    UPDATES["server-driven updates"] --> PUSH["push (FCM) over poll - radio wakes only on real news (Ch 50)"]
    DEFER --> BATCH["batch + coalesce requests - amortize radio tail (Ch 82)"]
    PUSH --> BATCH
    BATCH --> METERED{metered or Data Saver}
    METERED -->|yes| GATE["gate heavy transfers on Wi-Fi, adapt quality (Ch 68/59)"]
    METERED -->|no - unmetered| TRANSFER["efficient transfer: delta sync + gzip + HTTP cache + backoff (Ch 29/67)"]
    GATE --> TRANSFER
    TRANSFER --> CITIZEN["good citizen: no excessive wakeups/wakelocks/background data"]
    MEASURE["measure: Battery Historian + Android vitals + Network Inspector (Ch 85)"] -.-> CITIZEN
